        "category": "ancestry",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your broad repertoire of instruments and performances allows you to showcase many different styles, provided you have time to rehearse beforehand. As part of your daily preparations, you can select a second specialty from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Virtuosic Performer]. You gain the benefits of Virtuosic Performer for the selected specialty until you select a different specialty.</p>\n<p>Additionally, whenever you @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Perform] with the bonus from Virtuosic Performer, you gain temporary Hit Points equal to half your level that last for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feat-effects.Item.Effect: Adaptable Performer]</p>"
        },
